title: Seats in Sovnarkom
card-image: img/cards/sovnarkom_seats.svg?v=2
subtitle: Hold the commissariats, or trade them for policy.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: player_party = 'lsr' and lsr_in_gov = 1 and bol_regime = 1 and sovnarkom_seats_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; sovnarkom_seats_timer = 3

Seven Left SRs sit in Lenin's government: Steinberg at Justice, Kolegaev at Agriculture, Proshian at Posts and Telegraphs, and four others. The Bolsheviks need us: we have the peasants, and they have none. Every seat is a lever, and a hostage. (Seats held: [+ lsr_seats +].)

- @land: Carry out the land redistribution through Kolegaev's commissariat.
- @legality: Push Steinberg's revolutionary legality in the Council of People's Commissars.
- @trade: Trade a commissariat for a policy.
- @hold: Defend the party's seats against the Bolsheviks' encroachments.
- @easy_discard

@land
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -8, rel_bol: 2});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 5, soldiers: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 2, -2);
!}

The land committees have been given the machinery of the state to divide the estates, according to the law that the Left SRs themselves drafted. It is the one thing in the government that is done as the party wished.

@legality
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {repression: -3, rel_bol: -3, soviet_democracy: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 2, -2);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 4);
!}

Steinberg's draft decree on revolutionary courts and the right of the accused to counsel was read in the Council of Commissars. Lenin said that the revolution would not survive a lawyers' paradise. The decree was shelved.

@trade
choose-if: lsr_seats >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have seats to spare.
on-arrival: {!
Q.lsr_seats -= 1;
RO.add(Q, {repression: -4, rel_bol: 3});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 0, 3);
!}

We gave up the Posts and Telegraphs commissariat in return for a halt to a series of arrests in the provinces. It is the first time a party has traded a ministry for the lives of its voters.

@hold
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 4, soviet_democracy: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, -2);
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 1});
!}

The party's commissars stood by each other in the Council, and told Lenin that the coalition would not survive a purge of its seats. They were listened to, which is more than anyone else has been.
